Package: intel-compilers-devel-ohpc
Architecture: all
Depends: ohpc-filesystem,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: intel-oneapi-compiler-dpcpp-cpp-2025.0,
            intel-oneapi-compiler-fortran-2025.0,
            intel-oneapi-mkl-devel-2025.0
Description: OpenHPC compatibility package for Intel(R) oneAPI HPC Toolkit
 Provides OpenHPC-style compatible modulefiles for use with the Intel(R)
 oneAPI HPC Toolkit. Installs module generation scripts that create
 modulefiles pointing to the pre-installed Intel oneAPI compilers
 (icx, icpx, ifx) at /opt/intel/oneapi/.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
